### ============================================
### 回收站/统计/专栏 模块测试 (:8089/:8090/:8091)
### ============================================

### ========== 回收站模块 ==========

### 1. 回收站列表
GET http://localhost:8080/recycle?current=1&size=10&type=&keyword=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 回收站统计
GET http://localhost:8080/recycle/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 回收项详情
GET http://localhost:8080/recycle/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 恢复单项
POST http://localhost:8080/recycle/restore/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 批量恢复
POST http://localhost:8080/recycle/restore/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2]

### 6. 永久删除单项
DELETE http://localhost:8080/recycle/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 批量永久删除
POST http://localhost:8080/recycle/delete/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2]

### 8. 清空回收站
DELETE http://localhost:8080/recycle/empty
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== 数据统计模块 ==========

### 9. 仪表盘总览
GET http://localhost:8080/analytics/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. 单指标趋势
GET http://localhost:8080/analytics/trend?metric=article_publish&days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 多指标趋势
GET http://localhost:8080/analytics/trend/all?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. 热门文章
GET http://localhost:8080/analytics/hot-articles?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. 分类统计
GET http://localhost:8080/analytics/category-stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. 作者统计
GET http://localhost:8080/analytics/author-stats?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. 导出 CSV
GET http://localhost:8080/analytics/export/articles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== 专栏模块 ==========

### 16. 专栏分页
GET http://localhost:8080/column?current=1&size=10&status=&featured=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. 全部专栏
GET http://localhost:8080/column/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. 创建专栏
# @name createColumn
POST http://localhost:8080/column
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java 后端专栏",
  "slug": "java-backend",
  "description": "Java 后端技术分享",
  "coverImage": "https://example.com/col.png",
  "authorId": 1,
  "authorName": "wanqiu",
  "isFeatured": true
}

> {% client.global.set("columnId", response.body.data); %}

### 19. 专栏详情
GET http://localhost:8080/column/{{columnId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. 收录文章到专栏
POST http://localhost:8080/column/{{columnId}}/articles?articleId=1&articleTitle=测试文章&note=推荐
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {% client.global.set("columnArticleId", response.body.data); %}

### 21. 专栏文章列表
GET http://localhost:8080/column/{{columnId}}/articles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 22. 更新专栏
PUT http://localhost:8080/column/{{columnId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java 后端专栏V2",
  "description": "更新描述",
  "isFeatured": false
}

### 23. 删除专栏文章
DELETE http://localhost:8080/column/articles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 24. 删除专栏
DELETE http://localhost:8080/column/{{columnId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
